    "faq": {
      "title": "Questions, answered",
      "items": [
        {
          "q": "How does per-user pricing work?",
          "a": "You pay for the people who build and view reports. Add or remove users any time — billing adjusts on your next invoice, with no minimum on annual plans beyond the seats included in each tier."
        },
        {
          "q": "Can I switch plans later?",
          "a": "Yes. Upgrade instantly and only pay the prorated difference. Downgrades take effect at the start of your next billing period, and your dashboards and connections carry over untouched."
        },
        {
          "q": "What happens after the free trial?",
          "a": "The 14-day trial includes Professional features. When it ends, pick a plan to keep going — nothing is deleted, and you won't be charged until you choose to continue."
        },
        {
          "q": "Do you offer annual billing?",
          "a": "Annual billing saves 20% across every paid tier. Toggle it at the top of this page to see the adjusted per-user rate before you commit."
        },
        {
          "q": "Is my data secure?",
          "a": "Data is encrypted in transit and at rest. Business adds audit logs and lineage; Enterprise adds SSO/SAML and custom data residency to meet your compliance requirements."
        },
        {
          "q": "What counts as a data source?",
          "a": "Any connected system FastBI reads from — a database, warehouse, spreadsheet, or one of 150+ app integrations. Each connection counts once, regardless of how many dashboards use it."
        }
      ]
    },
